                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-07-08"><hi rendition="#italic">July 8,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay directs Mr. Conger to accept China’s proposal in case of Etzel on terms
                    mentioned in Mr. Conger’s cable of the 5th instant.)</p>
            </div>
